  "origin": "When ysgnutcoh split his will into two spirits, the first was Kyreason — God of Light and Dark, holding both together. He was not given the light alone, the way lesser tellings would split good from evil; he was given the pair, undivided, and the neutrality to carry them. Through him the Heart's will became capability: everything the Heart *can* do flows down his line — Life and Matter, and Yield, the harvest of results. He and Darkness are ideally perfect working together toward the ideal world; where they disagree, it is on the method, never the destination.",
