  "origin": "The second spirit of the split is Darkness, God of the Unknown — born and made to withhold everything Kyreason was not capable of. That is his strange dignity: he is not the Heart's failure but its reserve, the complement created so that nothing the Heart needs is simply missing. Whether he is evil, the founder's record leaves exactly where he left it — he *may be* evil — and this dossier leaves it there too. He is the father of Time, Space, and Chaos: everything measured, everything placed, and everything unformed descends from the god of what is not yet known.",
