  "role": "Divine steward of Yield: the harvest of a thing — what an effort, a field, or a year actually returns; direct child of Kyreason.. This God holds a distinct responsibility within value, resources, markets, exchange, incentives, and the distribution of returns.",
  "function": "Within the world, this God helps value, resources, markets, exchange, incentives, and the distribution of returns. Their contribution is to make yield understandable, dependable, and beneficial, while cooperating with other domains rather than replacing them.",
  "group": "Economics & Exchange",
