  "house": "Darkness's line",
  "origin": "Darkness withheld, and somewhere in that withholding stands Chaos — though the record keeps two doors open on his beginning. By one, he was created from the withholding itself: the unformed given a keeper, so that formlessness had a house and a name. By the other, he was already in the abyss at the beginning, older than any making, present before the first form was drawn. The founder has closed neither door, and this dossier closes neither. What stands certain is his seat: Darkness's third line, alongside Time and Space, father of the deepest things.",
  "power": "Complete domain authority: God of Chaos fully masters God of Chaos in its full concept-specific scope: its forms, states, properties, patterns, causes, effects, and natural interactions. This God has complete mastery of god of chaos, not automatic sovereignty over the entire category \"Creation & Primordial Forces\" or over another God's distinct concept. Their authority is exercised in service of the world, ysgnutcoh, and their own divine purpose.",
  "tale": "Earth knows him best as the weather no one can fully foretell. A storm gathers from a thousand chances, and because its path cannot be known exactly, coastal towns evacuate early, ships run for harbor, and farmers watch the sky with humility. That unpredictability is his keeping, and it teaches Earth its most useful virtue: preparation without presumption. Deeper still, life itself advances by his looseness — variation, mutation, the slight difference in every offspring — so that when the world changes, something living is already ready for it. Chaos is why Earth can adapt instead of merely endure.",
