  "name": "God of Worth",
  "role": "Divine steward of Worth: value made a house — father of Money, Reputation, and Soul; child of Value.. This God holds a distinct responsibility within value, resources, markets, exchange, incentives, and the distribution of returns.",
  "function": "Within the world, this God helps value, resources, markets, exchange, incentives, and the distribution of returns. Their contribution is to make worth understandable, dependable, and beneficial, while cooperating with other domains rather than replacing them.",
  "group": "Economics & Exchange",
