  "role": "Divine steward of Intangible: worth without substance — the unseen half of value; child of Value, parent of Relation (Magnet was born here as Tangible and moved away, keeping his reference link home).. This God holds a distinct responsibility within value, resources, markets, exchange, incentives, and the distribution of returns.",
  "function": "Within the world, this God helps value, resources, markets, exchange, incentives, and the distribution of returns. Their contribution is to make intangible understandable, dependable, and beneficial, while cooperating with other domains rather than replacing them.",
