  "name": "God of Government",
  "role": "Divine steward of Government: rule organized — the governing of peoples; child of Tools, father of Domestic and International.. This God holds a distinct responsibility within rules, public institutions, authority, accountability, and organized decision-making.",
  "function": "Within the world, this God helps rules, public institutions, authority, accountability, and organized decision-making. Their contribution is to make government understandable, dependable, and beneficial, while cooperating with other domains rather than replacing them.",
