  "house": "Kyreason's line",
  "origin": "When the God of Government divided his rule, the first half was the rule that stays home. The God of Domestic is Government's child, the within-the-border half of his father's stewardship. The founder's own words define him, and they are kept as given: Domestic refers for the GOOD morality clean ethnicity and right justice. His origin is the founding of the home society itself — the moment the civilization decided that the life inside its own borders would be governed as carefully as any campaign beyond them.",
  "power": "Complete domain authority: God of Domestic fully masters God of Domestic in its full concept-specific scope: its forms, states, properties, patterns, causes, effects, and natural interactions. This God has complete mastery of god of domestic, not automatic sovereignty over the entire category \"Human Society & Relationships\" or over another God's distinct concept. Their authority is exercised in service of the world, ysgnutcoh, and their own divine purpose.",
  "tale": "His heroism is the quality of ordinary life inside a country that keeps its house well: courts that answer their own citizens fairly, streets kept, a people's shared life maintained with pride rather than neglect. Every nation on Earth is, before anything else, a domestic arrangement — millions of households under one rule — and the difference between a homeland people cherish and one they flee is his domain working or failing. The quiet pride of a well-kept town, a fair local court, a community that holds its own standard: that is the God of Domestic's mastery, felt by more people, more days, than any foreign triumph.",
  "job": "To connect and mediate domestic where needed; to organize its proper operation; and to support the world's wellbeing through responsible mastery of this domain.",
