   "function": "he is the Heart's standard inside the border — the home society held to the Heart's own definition.",
   "power": "His mastery is the home society held to its standard: the founder's definition — GOOD morality, clean ethnicity, and right justice — applied within the border. He governs the rule a people makes over its own house: its laws at home, its customs, its treatment of its own. Where his brother's power travels outward, his stays and tends; he is the standard by which a society judges whether its own household is in order, the Heart's definition carried into the daily government of the place people actually live.",
