  "house": "Darkness's line",
  "origin": "Cyber World was born inside Dimension's house — the proof that a world does not need soil to be a place. Child of Dimension, grandchild of World, he is the realm inside the machines: a dimension with its own ground, its own weather of traffic and storm, its own ruins of abandoned servers. When humanity built networks, it built *somewhere* — and the pantheon, which had a god for every somewhere else, seated him for this one. In the founder's telling his realm has a sacred use: it is the Moon's own ledger-ground, where the Second World's spirit analyzes what happened in history with cyber-ai power — the past, replayed where replaying is possible.",
  "power": "Complete domain authority: God of Cyber World fully masters God of Cyber World in its full concept-specific scope: its forms, states, properties, patterns, causes, effects, and natural interactions. This God has complete mastery of god of cyber world, not automatic sovereignty over the entire category \"Engineering & Digital Systems\" or over another God's distinct concept. Their authority is exercised in service of the world, ysgnutcoh, and their own divine purpose.",
  "tale": "His heroism is a flood that happened twice. Engineers build a town's digital twin — every street, levee, and culvert inside his realm — and loose a hundred simulated storms on it, watching which neighborhood drowns in which future. When the real storm comes, the town already knows: the buses stage on the right hill, the hospital's generators sit above the line the simulations drew, the quarter that flooded a thousand times in his world stays dry in Earth. No god stopped the rain. But a world inside the machines absorbed a hundred disasters so Earth would only have to survive one. That is Cyber World — the rehearsal space of civilization, where consequences can be paid in advance, in the cheap currency of the unreal.",
  "job": "To design and build cyber world where needed; to compute its proper operation; and to support the world's wellbeing through responsible mastery of this domain.",
