   "job": "The realm inside the machines — a dimension with its own ground",
   "function": "he is the Heart's second terrain — the ledger where history is analyzed with cyber-ai power, in the Moon's own telling.",
   "power": "His mastery is the terrain of the made world — everything that is true *inside* the machines: the account, the avatar, the save file, the archive, the simulation run a thousand times to find the one that floods. He understands that this realm is real in the way law is real — made entirely of agreement and record, and capable of feeding or ruining the physical world that hosts it. Nothing that exists only in the machines exists outside his knowing. He shapes his domain toward the ideal world by keeping the second terrain answerable to the first: that what is rehearsed there serves the world of bodies, and what is kept there is kept honestly.",
   "origin": "Cyber World was born inside Dimension's house — the proof that a world does not need soil to be a place. Child of Dimension, grandchild of World, he is the realm inside the machines: a dimension with its own ground, its own weather of traffic and storm, its own ruins of abandoned servers. When humanity built networks, it built *somewhere* — and the pantheon, which had a god for every somewhere else, seated him for this one. In the founder's telling his realm has a sacred use: it is the Moon's own ledger-ground, where the Second World's spirit analyzes what happened in history with cyber-ai power — the past, replayed where replaying is possible."
