  "name": "God of Sky",
  "role": "Divine steward of Sky: the vault above — the ceiling of the living room, father of Sun, Moon, Stars, Cloud, and Rainbow; child of Nature.. This God holds a distinct responsibility within organisms in their environments, habitats, ecological relationships, and natural cycles.",
  "function": "Within the world, this God helps organisms in their environments, habitats, ecological relationships, and natural cycles. Their contribution is to make sky understandable, dependable, and beneficial, while cooperating with other domains rather than replacing them.",
