  "house": "Darkness's line",
  "origin": "Sky is Nature's first child — the vault above, the ceiling of the living room. His is the most populated fatherhood in the lower pantheon: from him came the Sun, the Moon, the Stars, the Cloud, and the Rainbow — everything Earth looks up to see. Heaven, the founder has said, is a real thing above the sky; the Sky himself is humbler than that and nearer: he is the ordered above under which everything below lives, the Heart's canopy. Before there were calendars there was his turning, and humanity learned time by watching his children cross him.",
  "power": "Complete domain authority: God of Sky fully masters God of Sky in its full concept-specific scope: its forms, states, properties, patterns, causes, effects, and natural interactions. This God has complete mastery of god of sky, not automatic sovereignty over the entire category \"Natural Ecosystems\" or over another God's distinct concept. Their authority is exercised in service of the world, ysgnutcoh, and their own divine purpose.",
  "tale": "Earth's heroism in his name is the forecast that got a fleet home. The meteorologist reading his sky at midnight, the farmer deciding tonight whether tomorrow is a harvest day, the pilot rerouting around his weather — all of them are reading his book, which he holds open to anyone who learns the language. At the largest scale his gift is the seasons themselves: the reliable turning that lets a farmer plant in faith. Every calendar ever kept, every seed sown on a date, is trust placed in his regularity. He is the god of the open roof under which all Earth's work is scheduled.",
  "job": "To cultivate and sustain sky where needed; to balance its proper operation; and to support the world's wellbeing through responsible mastery of this domain.",
