  "house": "Kyreason's line",
  "origin": "Soul could be weighed, but a weight alone tells no one *where* the darkness sits. So Soul's first child was the examination: God of Readings, born to read the soul — to diagnose where its light stands and where the darkness has accumulated. He stands before his brother Cleanse in the order of the house, and the order is law in their father's house: nothing is judged, and nothing is cleansed, before it is truly read. First the truth of a soul, then — and only then — its restoration.",
  "power": "Complete domain authority: God of Readings fully masters God of Readings in its full concept-specific scope: its forms, states, properties, patterns, causes, effects, and natural interactions. This God has complete mastery of god of readings, not automatic sovereignty over the entire category \"Soul & Spirituality\" or over another God's distinct concept. Their authority is exercised in service of the world, ysgnutcoh, and their own divine purpose.",
  "tale": "Earth already trusts his pattern everywhere it matters. The doctor who runs the test before naming the treatment; the judge who reads the whole file before the sentence; the friend who listens to the end before answering — all of them work in his sequence. His heroism is the pause before judgment: in a world that condemns from headlines and absolves from charm, he insists the soul be *read* first, in full, in its own light and its own dark. Half of justice is that pause. He is the god who keeps it.",
  "job": "To discern and guide readings where needed; to reconcile its proper operation; and to support the world's wellbeing through responsible mastery of this domain.",
