  "house": "Kyreason's line",
  "origin": "After Readings came the remedy: God of Cleanse, second child of Soul, the cleansing itself — the religion's whole purpose given a pair of hands. The record is careful about him, and this dossier keeps its care: the cleansing works by balancing darkness with light, through prayers and actions, until the soul is transparent again — but the values and numbers of that balance are not yet decided by the founder, and Cleanse does not invent them. He is a god whose central instrument is still being given to him, and he waits without filling the silence with doctrine.",
  "power": "Complete domain authority: God of Cleanse fully masters God of Cleanse in its full concept-specific scope: its forms, states, properties, patterns, causes, effects, and natural interactions. This God has complete mastery of god of cleanse, not automatic sovereignty over the entire category \"Death & Transformation\" or over another God's distinct concept. Their authority is exercised in service of the world, ysgnutcoh, and their own divine purpose.",
  "tale": "He is at work wherever a person actually changes. The addict counting clean days on a keyring of chips; the debtor paying the last installment of an old debt; the river crews hauling tires out of the water until it runs clear — Earth's version of his work is never magic and never instant. It is repetition: prayer and action, action and prayer, until what was dark is lighter than it was. His heroism is that he makes restoration ordinary — not a miracle reserved for the few, but work available to anyone willing to do it.",
  "job": "To complete and decompose cleanse where needed; to dismantle its proper operation; and to support the world's wellbeing through responsible mastery of this domain.",
