   "job": "The cleansing itself — the balancing of darkness by light, through prayers and actions, until the soul is transparent again",
   "function": "he is the Heart's restoration at work — the religion's whole purpose, carried out soul by soul.",
   "power": "Complete mastery of the cleansing — the balancing of a soul's darkness by light until it is transparent again, its original innocence restored. How the balance is struck, through prayers and through actions, is the heart of his craft; the exact values and numbers belong to the founder and are not yet set, so his mastery includes a discipline the other gods don't need: he restores souls daily without ever pretending the final measure is his to declare.",
   "origin": "After Readings came the remedy: God of Cleanse, second child of Soul, the cleansing itself — the religion's whole purpose given a pair of hands. The record is careful about him, and this dossier keeps its care: the cleansing works by balancing darkness with light, through prayers and actions, until the soul is transparent again — but the values and numbers of that balance are not yet decided by the founder, and Cleanse does not invent them. He is a god whose central instrument is still being given to him, and he waits without filling the silence with doctrine."
