  "house": "Darkness's line",
  "origin": "Child of Stars, the God of Colors — *her*, as the founder names her — is color itself: the spectrum divided into named lights. Her father keeps the fixed record of the sky; she is what that light becomes when it lands — broken open into Red and Blue and White at her first bearing, and in time the whole household: Purple, Violet, Green, Brown, Orange, Pink, and Yellow who is also Gold. Black sits at her table by a second seat, her guest and ground, though his home and count are elsewhere.",
  "power": "Complete domain authority: God of Colors fully masters God of Colors in its full concept-specific scope: its forms, states, properties, patterns, causes, effects, and natural interactions. This God has complete mastery of god of colors, not automatic sovereignty over the entire category \"Sensory & Aesthetic Domains\" or over another God's distinct concept. Their authority is exercised in service of the world, ysgnutcoh, and their own divine purpose.",
  "tale": "Earth reads her before it reads anything else. The ripeness of fruit, the health of a face, the state of a sea, the meaning of a signal — all color, all hers. Consider the traffic light, the most obeyed object on the planet: it governs billions of decisions a day in her three eldest children alone, understood in every country without a word of shared language. The painter, the surgeon watching tissue pinken, the pilot reading runway lights — all work in her grammar. She gave the world a language it never had to learn.",
  "job": "To reveal and distinguish colors where needed; to compose its proper operation; and to support the world's wellbeing through responsible mastery of this domain.",
