  "origin": "Child of Colors, Purple is the royal meeting — the color born where Red and Blue, the shout and the distance, stop arguing and marry. He was not an early color but an earned one: for three thousand years he was the most expensive color on Earth, pressed drop by drop from sea-snails, reserved by law in empire after empire for the one head allowed to wear him. The world knew his worth before it could afford him, and the memory never left the color.",
