   "power": "Complete mastery of the meeting of opposites. He is the Heart's majesty — proof that two contrary lights can crown one head: passion and patience, blood and sky, held in a single shade without either surrendering. His power is legitimate rule made visible; where he appears, the world bows a little, from recognition that something costly stands there. He is what authority looks like reconciled with itself — the robe that fits because both halves were honored.",
