   "function": "he is the Heart's threshold — the final color before the invisible, where the known world ends and the Unknown begins.",
   "power": "Complete mastery of the threshold. He is the Heart's threshold — the final color before the invisible, where the known world ends and the Unknown begins. Beyond his post lies the ultraviolet: real, powerful, unseen — the rays that burn without being looked at. His power is border-keeping: he marks where seeing ends, so everything past him is honestly named faith or danger. When the Heart looks toward the void, Violet is the last light it looks through.",
