   "job": "The living color — the shade of every growing leaf, of spring, of the Living Eden World itself",
   "function": "he is the Heart's renewal — the color life wears when it begins again.",
   "power": "Complete mastery of the growing shade. He is the Heart's renewal — the color life wears when it begins again. His power is the visible signature of photosynthesis, the one transaction Earth cannot live without: sunlight in, food out, oxygen returned as change. Wherever he stands, something is converting light into life. His mastery is what the leaf *means* — growth resuming after winter, after fire, after ruin.",
