   "job": "The warming color — between Red's alarm and Yellow's light",
   "function": "he is the Heart's hearth-glow — urgency softened into welcome.",
   "power": "Complete mastery of tempered urgency. He is the Heart's hearth-glow — urgency softened into welcome. His power is the conversion of warning into warmth: he takes his eldest brother's shout and lowers it to a voice a tired person can act on without panic. Road crews and hunters wear him for one reason — he says *be careful* in a tone that informs rather than frightens. Nothing in his keeping blazes; everything in it glows.",
